  "edge_schema": "voltmarkt_edge_pat",
  "prompt": "For each month of 2025, compare Voltmarkt's net revenue with the same month a year before. Order dates are UTC days. Return three columns, in this order: month (the first day of the 2025 month), revenue_eur and revenue_prev_year_eur, the net revenue of the same month of 2024. A month of 2024 with no orders has nothing to compare with: show its revenue_prev_year_eur as missing. Return one row for each month of 2025. Any row order is fine.",
